","challengeDate":"May 12 — 25 <div class="sponsor-message"><h2>Welcome to Troll Farm</h2> <p><b>👥 This challenge is a return of the Community Challenge format!</b><br/> This one is brought to you by the following community members: <ul> <li><b>Development:</b> <a href="profile/8374201b6f1d19eb99d61c80351465b65150051">eulerscheZahl</a>, <a href="profile/433c83b2f60d89f64e138f0fce10b30f8598731">Illedan</a>, <a href="profile/b528dd3b279d7578674a1129305918e0400484">aCat</a>, and <a href="profile/f76499818f5cfc3f3fa8c0eb31e13344919268">Astrobytes</a></li> <li><b>Cover art:</b> <a href="profile/6674aa6bf63260e13f567033f1b528c39579261">MSz</a></li> <li><b>Tests:</b> <a href="profile/dfb886f869fc14dc31fc9191a1b87a608740451">struct</a></li> <li><b>French translation:</b> <a href="profile/a653cfddd3d35ffa628ec7135b38007c5337341">anochastic</a></li> </ul> Thank you to all of them for bringing this game to the community! </p> <p>🍎 Will you be able to maximize the efficiency of your farming, while your opponent does the same? Or will your strategy revolve around disruption above all else? Either way, or anywhere between and beyond, come participate in this returning Community format!</p> </div>","howTo":{"items":[{"text":"Participating in the event is free.","title":"How much does it cost?"},{"text":"The event starts on May 12th at 10am CET and ends on May 25th at 10am CET. It starts at the same time for all players in the world, whatever the time zone.","title":"When does it start and end?"},{"text":"Yes, you need to create a CodinGame account before being able to register for the challenge. We also suggest having a look at easy puzzles to get used to the platform.","title":"Do I need a CodinGame account to compete?"},{"text":"By default, if you've added your company to your profile, depending on your rank, you'll contribute to your company for the company leaderboard. In the same way, if you've added your school to your profile, depending on your rank, you'll contribute points to your school for the school leaderboard.  You can complete your <a href="/profile/" target="_blank" style="color:#f2bb13">profile here</a>.","title":"How can I compete for my school/company?"},{"text":"Only the top 100 schools and top 100 companies will be visible. Furthermore, it's possible to play the solo competition only.","title":"I'm afraid of projecting a negative image of my school/company if I rank poorly. What can I do?"},{"text":"This is a bot programming (AI) challenge. New in bot programming? No worries, <a href="/multiplayer/bot-programming/mad-pod-racing" target="_blank" style="color:#f2bb13">here's a guide for beginners</a>.","title":"What type of coding exercise should I expect?"},{"text":"We take the sum of points of the top 5 players in each company/school with at least 3 players. More info in this <a href="/forum/t/codingame-spring-challenge-2020/152927/" target="_blank" style="color:#f2bb13">forum's thread</a>.","title":"How are the school/company leaderboards computed?"},{"text":"Copying code between players is forbidden during contests. We'll thoroughly monitor players' submissions and we reserve ourselves the right to ban any player in case of abuse.","title":"What if people try to cheat the system or disturb the school/company leaderboards?"}],"title":"F.A.Q"},"prizes":null,"showUpdateButton":true,"endCta":null,"endCtaUrl":null,"prizesItems":[],"prizesTitle":""}
